#: ../../source/reference/layout.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Layout class is a base class used for managing the layout and "
"positioning of widgets within a graphical user interface (GUI). It "
"provides a structured way to organize UI elements, ensuring that they are"
" placed efficiently and consistently on the screen. The Layout class is "
"essential for developers who need to arrange multiple components (such as"
" buttons, labels, text fields, etc.) in a clean and organized manner."
msgstr ""

